254
00:12:55,191 --> 00:12:57,568
Well, obviously, this one got stuck in the box.

255
00:12:57,652 --> 00:12:59,487
That happens occasionally.

256
00:12:59,570 --> 00:13:02,198
It happens occasionally. And, so...

257
00:13:02,657 --> 00:13:04,909
