262
00:13:16,713 --> 00:13:19,048
Oh, okay. Well, yeah? Who wrote it?

263
00:13:19,132 --> 00:13:20,258
Tom? Tom.

264
00:13:20,341 --> 00:13:22,760
Then, it is a joke because there's nobody in here named Tom.

265
00:13:22,844 --> 00:13:26,347
Tom? He worked in accounting up until about a year ago.

266
00:13:28,266 --> 00:13:29,392
Tom.

267
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:34,397
Oh, that guy? That guy was weird.

268
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:37,233
All right, next suggestion. Next suggestion.

269
00:13:39,402 --> 00:13:41,404
"You need to do something about your B.O."

270
00:13:41,487 --> 00:13:43,614
"You need to do something about your B.O."

271
00:13:43,698 --> 00:13:47,368
Okay. Now, I don't know who this suggestion is meant for,

272
00:13:47,452 --> 00:13:49,704
but it's more of a personal suggestion.

273
00:13:49,787 --> 00:13:51,497
And it's not an office suggestion.

274
00:13:51,581 --> 00:13:54,292
Far be it from me to use this as a platform to embarrass anybody.

275
00:13:54,375 --> 00:13:57,670
Aren't the suggestions meant for you?

276
00:13:58,087 --> 00:14:00,840
Well, Toby, if by me

277
